                                                "sense_id": "2d325051-9c94-3e21-afcc-2ce1281967ad",
                                                "text": "This done, he removed the hat; and having touched his forehead lightly with a silk handkerchief, for the afternoon sun was warm, gazed about him with a grave distaste. “A scaly neighbourhood!” he murmured. The young man’s judgment was one at which few people with an eye for beauty would have cavilled."
